{"message":"For the lowest potential ATM costs abroad, World Blue is the best match: it charges no Rho fee for foreign ATM withdrawals and automatically rebates foreign ATM operator fees up to $100 per calendar month. However, it is a business checking account with a $50 monthly maintenance fee and a $10,000 minimum balance requirement, so it may not be appropriate for a personal photography trip.

If you need a personal checking account, the strongest alternative identified is Bluest: no Rho foreign ATM withdrawal fee, plus up to $50 per monthly statement cycle in ATM-fee rebates. Its monthly maintenance fee was not available in the information retrieved. Green Fee-Free also has no Rho foreign ATM fee and a $22.50 monthly fee that is waived with a $150 minimum daily balance, but no operator-fee rebate was specified.

I have not opened an account because Rho-Bank does not provide an account-opening action here. Foreign ATM operators may still impose fees; when available, choose local-currency billing and decline dynamic currency conversion."}

